   "The booklet has no inventory page with Element IDs, so every element ID was matched by eye to the closest catalogue entry. Colours are in props.",
   "The main body is a dark-grey wedge plate. The nearest catalogue entry, lego-wedge-plate-4x4-cut, is a guess.",
   "The body is drawn with a blue plate already on it in step 1, and a light-grey piece appears between the two blue plates in step 2. I modelled two blue 2x2 plates plus a light-grey 2x2 plate, all on body studs.",
   "The black arm with clip ends in cockpit step 2 does not appear in any parts box. I modelled it as lego-4223247, clipped to the cockpit plate and to the body's underside clip plate (step 6).",
